  "id" : "ELTS_score.v0.0.1",
  "gdl_version" : "2.1",
  "concept" : "gt0001",
  "language" : {
    "original_language" : "ISO_639-1::en"
  },
  "description" : {
    "original_author" : {
      "name" : "Kevin Arjona",
      "email" : "kevin.arjona@cambio.se",
      "organisation" : "Cambio CDS",
      "date" : "2026-07-28"
    },
    "lifecycle_state" : "DRAFTED",
    "details" : {
      "en" : {
        "id" : "en",
        "purpose" : "To calculate and assess the calculated value and risk group for the ELTS score.",
        "keywords" : [
          "elts",
          "eutos",
          "cml",
          "chronic",
          "myeloid",
          "leukemia",
          "survival",
          "risk",
          "score",
          "oncology",
          "hematology"
        ],
        "use" : "Use to calculate the ELTS score and assess the corresponding risk group in patients with chronic myeloid leukemia. \n\nThe formula used to calculate the score requires continuous variables:\n\nage: patient age in years;\n\nspleen size below costal margin: measured in cm;\n\nperipheral blood blasts: measured as a percentage;\n\nplatelet count: measured in 10^9/l.\n\nThe formula calculates the score as: 0.0025 * (age / 10)^3 + 0.0615 * spleen size + 0.1052 * blasts + 0.4104 * (platelet count / 1000)^-0.5. \n\nThe score is then mapped to a risk group:\n\nlow risk: score ≤ 1.568;\n\nintermediate risk: score > 1.568 and ≤ 2.2185;\n\nhigh risk: score > 2.2185.",
        "misuse" : "Not to be used for assessment of the ELTS score in patients under 18 years of age. \n\nNot to be used for patients with other myeloproliferative neoplasms.",
        "copyright" : "© Cambio CDS"
      }
    },
    "other_details" : {
      "references" : "Nationellt vårdprogram kronisk myeloisk leukemi [Internet]. Regionala cancercentrum i samverkan; 2024 [cited 2026 Jul 28]. Available from: https://kunskapsbanken.cancercentrum.se/diagnoser/kml/vardprogram/kategorisering-i-sjukdomsfaser-samt-riskgruppering/\n\nPfirrmann M, Baccarani M, Saussele S, Guilhot J, Cervantes F, Ossenkoppele G, Hoffmann VS, Castagnetti F, Hasford J, Hehlmann R, Simonsson B. Prognosis of long-term survival considering disease-specific death in patients with chronic myeloid leukemia. Leukemia. 2016 Jan;30(1):48-56. doi: 10.1038/leu.2015.261. Epub 2015 Sep 29. PMID: 26416462.",
      "en" : "The ELTS score is a further development of the EUTOS (European Treatment Outcome Study) score with an emphasis on long-term outcomes and the likelihood of CML patients dying from their underlying hematological disease."
    }
  },
